{"path":"thread/shared_lock/operator=","title":"std::shared_lock<Mutex>::operator=","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::shared_lock&lt;Mutex&gt;::</span>operator=","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/thread/shared_lock/operator=","section":"thread","kind":"page","summary":"Move assignment operator. Replaces the contents with those of other using move semantics.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx14\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">shared_lock<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> operator<span class=\"sy1\">=</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> shared_lock<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> other <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx14\">(since C++14)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Move assignment operator. Replaces the contents with those of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">other</span></code> using move semantics. \n</p><p>If, prior to this call, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> has an associated mutex ((<span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/shared_lock/mutex\">mutex()</a></span> returns a non-null pointer) and has acquired ownership of it (<span class=\"t-lc\">owns()</span> returns <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code>), the mutex is unlocked by calling <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/shared_mutex/unlock_shared\">unlock_shared()</a></span>.\n</p><p>After this call, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">other</span></code> has no associated mutex.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> other\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> another <code>shared_lock</code> to replace the state with\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code>\n</p>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"thread","title":"Concurrency support library (since C++11)"},{"path":"thread/shared_lock","title":"std::shared_lock"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::shared_lock<Mutex>::operator=","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++14. Move assignment operator. Replaces the contents with those of other using move semantics."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"other"},{"label":"Return value","note":"*this"}]},"standards":["C++14"],"wordCount":73,"codeBlockCount":0}
